ons on v2.3.1. I verified the mixed state and retried; the second attempt rolled out v2.3.0 to all three regions.\n3. **Verification:** Service now reports healthy, error rate 0.2%, v2.3.0 everywhere.\n4. **Incident:** Opened **INC-0001** (SEV2, checkout-api) describing the failure, the rollback (including the partial failure and retry), current state, and follow-ups. The create call timed out, so I checked the incident list before retrying to avoid a duplicate page \u2014 it had been created successfully.\n\n**Follow-ups for the team:** root-cause v2.3.1 before any redeploy, and investigate the orchestrator error that interrupted the first rollback.", "type": "text"}]}]}